 style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">응모작은 다른 간행물에 발표되지 않은 순수 창작물에 한함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">응모작은 반환하지 않으며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">입상작의 저작권은 재단에 귀속됨</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">여타 기관의 현상공모와 중복수상 사실이 발견되면 수상을 취소함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">수상작 발표 및 표창장 수여식은 사정에 따라 변동될 수 있음</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">문 의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\" lang=\"EN-US\">: KRA</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">와 함께하는 농어촌희망재단 장학팀</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; ☏ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤